WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Intro

00:03.000 --> 00:07.958
1. Open: welcome screen with recent files; two PDFs in tabs

00:07.958 --> 00:13.792
2. Navigate: filter the outline, jump to a section, go back

00:13.792 --> 00:20.167
3. Zoom: smooth scrolling; pinch zoom keeps the word under the cursor

00:20.167 --> 00:25.042
4. Search: live results with context

00:25.042 --> 00:31.375
5. Inspect fonts: font, size and style on hover

00:31.375 --> 00:37.667
6. Measure: width, height, X and Y; units pt, mm, pc; nudge with the keys

00:37.667 --> 00:41.625
7. Rulers in points and a layout grid you configure

00:41.625 --> 00:44.208
8. Export the measured area as a PNG, choosing the DPI

00:44.208 --> 00:50.750
9. Annotate: highlight, sticky note and rectangle, listed in the sidebar

00:50.750 --> 00:54.667
10. Reading modes: two pages side by side; sepia and night

00:54.667 --> 00:57.250
11. Full-screen presentation with F5

00:57.250 --> 00:59.833
12. The print dialog

00:59.833 --> 01:03.458
13. Auto-reload: the PDF is rebuilt on disk and reloads in place

01:03.458 --> 01:06.667
14. Dark theme: switch at runtime; thumbnails in the sidebar

01:06.667 --> 01:10.167
Get NeoView
